%%MatrixMarket matrix coordinate real symmetric
% Mixed-sign off-diagonals and no diagonal at all: neither an assembled
% Laplacian/SDDM operator (those have non-positive off-diagonals) nor a
% weighted adjacency matrix (those have non-negative ones). --input-kind auto
% must refuse this rather than silently solve one of the two readings.
4 4 3
2 1 1
3 2 -1
4 3 1
